---
import V2 from '../layouts/Archive.astro';
import SubmissionForm from '../components/SubmissionForm.astro';
---
<V2 title="AI娘表情包投稿 - 站内快速投稿与 GitHub 表单 | 蓝色大肥鱼" desc="提交 AI 娘表情包，上传图片、填写名称和角色并选择是否署名；署名时填写名字，个人主页链接和说明可选。站内快速投稿与 GitHub 表单均可，来源、授权与分类由维护者审核补充。" path="/submit.html" active="submit" bodyPage="submit" pageStyles={["/page-styles/submit.css?v=2"]} robots="index,follow">
<div class="page">

    <h1 class="page-title" data-i18n="submit.h1">投稿</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-i18n="submit.lede">把你的 AI 娘二创表情包交给我们归档。可以直接在本页快速投稿，也可以走 GitHub 表单；填写图片、名称、角色，并选择是否署名，说明可选；其余收录信息由维护者审核时补齐，审核通过后批量发布。</p>

    <h2 class="section-label" data-i18n="submit.guide.title">投稿指南</h2>
    <div class="submit-top">
    <div class="guide-main">
    <div class="panel guide-card">
      <p><span data-i18n="submit.what.a">本站收录 </span><strong data-i18n="submit.what.b">AI 角色的拟人化二创表情包</strong><span data-i18n="submit.what.c">：梗图、插画、设定图、多格漫画都可以，主角是各大 AI 产品的娘化角色（DeepSeek娘、豆包娘、Kimi娘……）就行。</span></p>
      <p><strong class="marker-highlight" data-i18n="submit.notTitle">以下四类不收：</strong></p>
      <ol class="rule-list">
        <li data-i18n="submit.not1">真人肖像、未授权的商业素材，以及跟 AI 角色无关的通用表情包；</li>
        <li data-i18n="submit.not2">违法、仇恨、骚扰他人的内容；</li>
        <li data-i18n="submit.not3">来源和授权都说不清、又拒绝补充的图片；</li>
        <li data-i18n="submit.not4">血腥、裸露、猎奇等明显让人不适的内容。</li>
      </ol>
      <p data-i18n="submit.boundary">没写到的边界按常识判断，维护者保留是否收录的最终决定权。</p>
      <p><strong data-i18n="submit.format.a">格式要求：</strong><span data-i18n="submit.format.b">PNG / JPG / GIF / WebP / APNG，单张 ≤ 10 MB；尽量传原图，别传带聊天框的截图或二次压缩过的图。</span></p>
      <p><strong class="marker-highlight" data-i18n="submit.onlyTitle">投稿时只需：</strong><span data-i18n="submit.onlyBody">上传图片、填写图片名称和角色，并选择是否署名。署名时名字必填，个人主页可留空；一句话说明可选。Tag、分类、来源、授权和详情页文案由维护者看图审核后补齐；如果知道来源或授权信息，可以写在说明里或在 Issue 评论中补充。</span></p>
      <p><strong class="marker-highlight" data-i18n="submit.confirmTitle">提交前必须确认三条：</strong></p>
      <ol class="rule-list">
        <li data-i18n="submit.confirm1">我确认自己有权提交这张图片，或已获原作者允许；</li>
        <li data-i18n="submit.confirm2">同意维护者核实后收录，并在收到版权要求时修改信息或删除；</li>
        <li data-i18n="submit.confirm3">知道本站是非官方同人整理项目，图片著作权始终归原作者。</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="submit-aside" aria-labelledby="qq-card-title">
      <div class="panel qq-card">
        <span class="tape-strip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h3 class="group-label" id="qq-card-title" data-i18n="submit.qq.title">群内投稿</h3>
        <div class="prose">
          <p><span data-i18n="submit.qq.a">QQ 群「鱼之饭盆」，群号 </span><span class="marker-highlight qq-number">1060898801</span><span data-i18n="submit.qq.c">。把图发到群里并 @维护者，也算投稿。</span></p>
        </div>
        <figure class="group-qr">
          <img src="/qq-group.png" alt="QQ 群「鱼之饭盆」（群号 1060898801）的加入二维码" width="518" height="518" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-i18n-attr="alt:qq.qrAlt" />
          <figcaption data-i18n="qq.scan">扫码进群</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <button type="button" class="btn" id="btn-qq-copy">
          <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5.5" y="5.5" width="8" height="8" rx="1" /><path d="M10.5 5.5v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2" /></svg>
          <span id="btn-qq-copy-text" data-i18n="qq.copy">复制群号</span>
        </button>
        <p class="hint" data-i18n="submit.qq.hint">收录仍以投稿表单为准：群内投稿的图会由维护者代走表单流程，来源与授权随后补齐。</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-label" data-i18n="submit.channel.title">快速投稿入口</h2>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="panel channel-card tilt-l">
        <span class="tape-strip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="channel-head">
          <h3 data-i18n="submit.channel.github">GitHub 投稿表单</h3>
          <span class="sticker-tag is-on" data-i18n="submit.channel.githubOn">已开通 · 推荐</span>
        </div>
        <p class="channel-desc" data-i18n="submit.channel.githubDesc">可直接拖图上传，填写图片名称、角色并选择是否署名。署名名字按选择填写，个人主页和说明可选。</p>
        <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/lmy414/ai-girl-stickers/issues/new?template=sticker-submission.yml" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.5 2.5H13.5V6.5" /><path d="M13.5 2.5 7.5 8.5" /><path d="M12 9.5V13.5H2.5V4H6.5" /></svg>
          <span data-i18n="submit.channel.open">打开投稿表单</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="panel channel-card tilt-r">
        <span class="tape-strip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="channel-head">
          <h3 data-i18n="submit.channel.feishu">飞书投稿</h3>
          <span class="sticker-tag" data-i18n="submit.channel.feishuTag">占位 · 即将开通</span>
        </div>
        <p class="channel-desc" data-i18n="submit.channel.feishuDesc">飞书投稿通道仍在筹备中，当前请使用上方 GitHub 投稿表单。</p>
        <button type="button" class="btn" disabled>
          <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 1.3 10 14.7 7.3 8.7 1.3 6z" /><path d="M14.7 1.3 7.3 8.7" /></svg>
          <span data-i18n="submit.channel.soon">即将开通</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-label" data-i18n="submit.form.title">快速投稿</h2>
    <div class="panel form-sheet">
      <span class="tape-strip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="form-notice"><strong class="marker-highlight" data-i18n="submit.form.noticeA">站内快速投稿已开放</strong><span data-i18n="submit.form.noticeB"> · 提交后进入审核队列，审核通过后批量发布</span></p>
      <SubmissionForm />
    </div>
    <p class="note" data-i18n="submit.note1">也可以继续使用上方的 GitHub 投稿表单；两种入口都会进入同一审核队列。</p>

    <p class="note" data-i18n="submit.note2">投稿不会立即上线：维护者会看图补充 Tag、分类、来源和授权信息，审核通过后批量发布；期间可能会向你确认信息。</p>
</div>
<Fragment slot="scripts">
    <script is:inline src="/site-data.js" defer></script>
    <script is:inline src="/page-scripts/submit-0.js?v=2" defer></script>
</Fragment>
</V2>
